# INVWINEB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: Move and DEL on
# every row of the item list at level 3, the 260 items of
# INVWIN_WINSEEDEB, more than a page and more than a byte counts.  With
# all chosen, Move (ALT-C M) asks once, its caption naming the first
# item and 259 more, and moves all 260 to Shelf A1, the note counting
# them and the list, fetched again once, with its focus row alone
# chosen.  DEL asks once, saying that it is every item of the list,
# those not shown too, its default No: No sends nothing and keeps all
# chosen.  Yes, by ENTER on its button, with an Esc that the driver
# types as the loop starts (an A line: a P line's would go with the
# question's box), deletes the first item and stops, the box saying 1
# of 260, the list then counting 259, one row chosen.  CTRL-/ again
# chooses the 259 left and DEL, Yes deletes them all: the empty list, 0
# items, the note counting 259, where CTRL-/ does nothing.  The end by
# Exit. TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINEB.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/selchk.py
# checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER CTRL-SLASH ALT-C M
S ASKMOVE
T A1
K ENTER
S MOVED
K PGDN
S MOVEDPG
K CTRL-SLASH DEL
S DELASK
K N
S DELNO
K DEL LEFT ENTER
A ESC
S DELSTOP
K ENTER
S DELHALT
K CTRL-SLASH
S ALL259
K DEL Y
S DELDONE
K CTRL-SLASH
S EMPTYALL
K ALT-F X
